    <briefdescription>
<para>This file contains the SLH-DSA (FIPS 205) client function prototypes for the ASU SLH-DSA module. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The client APIs marshal the request parameters into an IPI command and forward it to ASUFW; the actual signing and verification are performed by the ASUFW SLH-DSA module. Key pair generation is not an SLH-DSA module command: it is requested through the key manager, using XAsu_KmGenerateSlhdsaKeyPair.</para><para><preformatted>
MODIFICATION HISTORY:</preformatted></para><para><preformatted>Ver   Who  Date     Changes
<hruler/>

1.0   kk   07/10/26 Initial release</preformatted></para><para><preformatted></preformatted> </para>    </detaileddescription>
